+# Version Scheme
+
+This project uses semantic versioning (semver) for its version numbers, in the explicit MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH format. The decision was recorded on 2026-09-23 and rests on semver giving dependency tools and developers clear signals about breaking changes, compatibility requirements, and upgrade safety, which makes it the better fit for dependency management.
